# AI agent instructions
AGENTS.md

# High-volume local benchmark telemetry.
# direct-saturation.json holds full per-repeat sample series and
# injector-<rate>-<repeat>.json holds full per-event injector output from
# scripts/benchmark/direct_saturation.py and direct_injector.py; both are
# useful locally for analysis but make commits/history unnecessarily large.
# Compact evidence (README rows, summaries, EXPLAIN output, migration
# artifacts) stays tracked - only these two raw telemetry filenames are
# excluded.
artifacts/benchmark/**/direct-saturation.json
artifacts/benchmark/**/injector-*.json
